WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.308
Across the board, automatic clipping matches or
outperforms the state of the art,

00:00:06.388 --> 00:00:10.172
and it does so without ever tuning the threshold.

00:00:10.252 --> 00:00:12.696
For GPT2 text generation on E2E,

00:00:12.776 --> 00:00:18.611
AUTO-S reaches a BLEU score of sixty-four point one
eight at epsilon three,

00:00:18.691 --> 00:00:23.263
edging past the prior best of sixty-three point
eight five.

00:00:23.343 --> 00:00:29.020
For RoBERTa-base on SST-2, it reaches ninety-two
point three two percent,

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:32.412
above the prior ninety-one point eight six.

00:00:32.492 --> 00:00:39.746
On CIFAR-10 with a pretrained SimCLRv2 it hits
ninety-two point seven percent at epsilon two.

00:00:39.826 --> 00:00:43.768
And because only the learning rate needs searching,

00:00:43.848 --> 00:00:47.080
the tuning cost drops by about five times.
